        "language": "english",
        "review": "Cannot recommend this game enough! I'm not often a fan of rhythm games as I'm almost never able to enter a flow state and focus almost entirely on the music, but here it feels almost instinctive. The level design is spectacular, and the music is killer. Everything from synth-y house/pop to Mongolian throat-singing metal.\n\nAlso, don't expect most roguelites like this to have much in the way of a story. but here I find it really compelling. The way the songs and their narratives and the different gods you have join you and narrate the stories feels so akin to oral storytelling traditions, and the world and mythology that the story hints at are far deeper than they seem on the surface.",
